{"id":"16154750d33f58cc","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-free-variable.md","title":"项变量与自由变量","display":"df-free-variable — 项变量与自由变量","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-free-variable","aliases":["43-df-free-variable"],"display":"df-free-variable — 项变量与自由变量","depends_on":["[[43-df-formula]]","[[43-df-term]]","[[43-df-atomic-formula]]","[[43-df-first-order-language]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-free-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-free-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-variable — 项变量与自由变量"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a4ba10013f4fc82\" href=\"?note=1a4ba10013f4fc82\" title=\"43-df-formula\">43-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"961683c3b48a18ae\" href=\"?note=961683c3b48a18ae\" title=\"43-df-term\">43-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f36fa03fda24ed88\" href=\"?note=f36fa03fda24ed88\" title=\"43-df-atomic-formula\">43-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"809479f98d99c157\" href=\"?note=809479f98d99c157\" title=\"43-df-first-order-language\">43-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\">\\(L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in L_{\\rm Const}\">\\(c\\in L_{\\rm Const}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\">\\(f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\">\\(R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L\">\\(t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_L\\)</span>。构造函数采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"961683c3b48a18ae\" href=\"?note=961683c3b48a18ae\" title=\"43-df-term\">43-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f36fa03fda24ed88\" href=\"?note=f36fa03fda24ed88\" title=\"43-df-atomic-formula\">43-df-atomic-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1a4ba10013f4fc82\" href=\"?note=1a4ba10013f4fc82\" title=\"43-df-formula\">43-df-formula</a>；以下沿有限语法树递归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L:\\operatorname{Term}_L\\to\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Var}),\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}_L:\\operatorname{Fml}_L\\to\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L:\\operatorname{Term}_L\\to\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Var}),\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}_L:\\operatorname{Fml}_L\\to\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(x):=\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(c):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))):=\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(x):=\\{x\\},\\quad\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(c):=\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(\\operatorname{FunTerm}(f,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))):=\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u)):=\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(u),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Rel}(R,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))):=\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u)):=\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\\cup\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(u),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Rel}(R,(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))):=\\bigcup_{i=1}^n\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Neg}(\\varphi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{And}(\\varphi,\\psi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Or}(\\varphi,\\psi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\psi),\\quad\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Imp}(\\varphi,\\psi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{All}(x,\\varphi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\operatorname{Ex}(x,\\varphi)):=\\operatorname{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递归覆盖每个已定义语法构造；没有依赖Remark来确定连接词或量词分支。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1a4ba10013f4fc82","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-term","status":"resolv